"},{"chapter":"b2-69-goethe-zertifikat-b2-final","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, morgen ist es endlich so weit. Wie fühlst du dich?","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_069_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-69-goethe-zertifikat-b2-final","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Ehrlich gesagt etwas nervös, aber ich glaube, wir haben wirklich genug geübt.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_069_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-69-goethe-zertifikat-b2-final","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Da stimme ich dir zu. Sollen wir noch einmal die Redemittel für den mündlichen Teil durchgehen?","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_069_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-69-goethe-zertifikat-b2-final","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Gute Idee, danach fühle ich mich bestimmt sicherer.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_069_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Da stimme ich dir zu, aber wir haben gründlich geübt.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-69-goethe-zertifikat-b2-final","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-69-goethe-zertifikat-b2-final","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Dein Kollege ist nervös vor der Prüfung. Beruhige ihn.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Zuerst nenne ich die Vorteile, dann die Nachteile, und am Ende meine Meinung.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-69-goethe-zertifikat-b2-final","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-69-goethe-zertifikat-b2-final","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-p